# archiv-agent (Open_source Edition, Apache-2.0) — standalone ignore.
#
# This crate is published open-core as its own repository; when `agent/` is the
# git root, these rules apply. The umbrella repo already ignores /agent/target/
# from its own root — this file makes the ignore travel with the agent tree.

# Cargo build cache — regenerated by `cargo build` (~2 GB), never committed.
/target/

# Note: Cargo.lock IS committed — archiv-agent ships as an application binary,
# so the lockfile is part of the reproducible-build contract (Dockerfile, trust/03).

# Release-gate scratch (run.sh writes to /tmp, but guard against local overrides).
*.profraw
perf.data*
flamegraph.svg

# OS + editor metadata (machine-specific).
.DS_Store
/.vscode/
/.idea/
*.swp